&lt;h2&gt;Safer file operations and clearer tab groups&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This update protects local files during rename, adds a recoverable remote editing flow, and keeps new tabs visible under group filters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect local files during rename&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If the destination name already exists, PromeFTP stops and preserves both files.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Edit remote files&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Open a remote file in your text editor, choose whether to upload it, and keep a local copy if upload is skipped or fails.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep new tabs visible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;New connections join the selected tab group while a group filter is active.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refresh the app icon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The PromeFTP mark combines a letter P with a file corner and transfer arrow.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.4"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
